classDiagram
    class Owner {
        +str name
        +List~Pet~ pets
        +add_pet(pet) None
        +get_pet(pet_id) Pet
        +get_all_tasks() List~Task~
    }
    class Pet {
        +str id
        +str name
        +str species
        +List~Task~ tasks
        +add_task(task) None
        +list_tasks() List~Task~
    }
    class Task {
        +str id
        +str pet_id
        +str description
        +datetime due
        +int duration_minutes
        +str priority
        +str frequency
        +bool completed
        +mark_complete() bool
    }
    class Scheduler {
        +Owner owner
        +filter_tasks(pet_id, completed, on_date) List~Task~
        +sort_by_time(tasks) List~Task~
        +sort_by_priority(tasks) List~Task~
        +detect_conflicts(on_date) List~str~
        +mark_task_complete(task_id) Task
        +update_task(task_id, changes) Task
        +build_plan(on_date, start, end) dict
    }
    Owner "1" o-- "0..*" Pet : cares for
    Pet "1" *-- "0..*" Task : contains occurrences
    Scheduler --> Owner : calls get_all_tasks
    Scheduler ..> Task : sorts, filters, completes
    Scheduler ..> Pet : attaches next occurrence
